paragraph.math:
$$\begin{matrix}
      {\text{det }EA} & {= a_{i1}\left( {- 1} \right)^{i + 1}\text{det }B_{i1} + \cdots + a_{in}\text{(} - 1\text{)}^{i + n}\text{det }B_{in}} \\
       & {= \alpha a_{i1}\left( {- 1} \right)^{i + 1}\text{det }A_{i1} + \cdots + \alpha a_{in}{\text{(} - 1\text{)}}^{i + n}\text{det }A_{in}} \\
       & {= \alpha~\text{det }A}
      \end{matrix}$$

